==Trivia==
*Its sprites are used as placeholders for unimplemented or regional exclusive units.
*Cat has the most variants out of all the Cats in the game.
*[[Version 2.0 Update#Version 2.0.4 Update|Version 2.0.4]] reduced Mohawk Cat's base health from 300 to 200 and base attack from 24 to 16.
*Prior to [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]], Macho Cat was a part of three other [[Cat Combo]]s: [[Cat Army MkII (Removed Combo)|Cat Army MkII]], [[Maxed Out (Removed Combo)|Maxed Out]] and [[Biceps (Removed Combo)|Biceps]].
*In [[The Battle Cats POP!]], this unit is called "Basic Cat".
*[[Squish Ball Cat (Special Cat)|Muscleman Cat]]'s description says that it is Macho Cat's trainer.
*According to [[Media:FamCom 20150401.jpg|this 4koma]], Mohawk Cat is the same cat as [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Rocker Cat]].
*A Doge disguised as Mohawk Cat was the culprit who sabotaged the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] in the [[PONOS Campaigns/MISSION IMPAWSIBLE|MISSION IMPAWSIBLE]] [[PONOS Campaigns|Campaign]].
*Prior to [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]], Cat's descriptions read as follows:
